  "name": "Tome keeper",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-worn-brown.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "You carry a spellbook. During Downtime, you can scribe a spell from any spell list into it, copying it from a scroll, another spellbook or a teacher; you learn that spell without needing a spell tome, and the source is not consumed. You do not suffer Bane for casting a spell written in your spellbook, even if it is not on your spell list. Lose the book, and you keep the spells but lose this benefit until you scribe a new one.",
